Begin3
Title:                pdTree
Version:              1.02-1a
Entered-date:         2004-05-22
Description:          Display the folder structure of a drive or path.
Keywords:             tree, FreeDOS, DOS, Win32
Author:               Kenneth J. Davis <jeremyd@computer.org>
Maintained-by:        Kenneth J. Davis <jeremyd@computer.org>
Defunct-primary-site: http://www.darklogic.org/fdos/ftp/tree/
Platforms:            DOS (TC30, BC31), Win32 (VC5, BCC55)
Copying-policy:       Public Domain (optional use of LGPL catgets by Jim Hall)
Summary:              Graphically displays the folder structure of a drive or path. Supports long file names if LFN api present, support for message catalogs (different languages) using cats, and supports both Windows NT/9x and DOS.
Modified-date:        2025-04-10.0
End
